    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following job application and evaluate the candidate against the most relevant job description from the Job Lookup Tool.\n\nCandidate Email:\n{{ $json.sent_email }}\n\nEmail Content:\n{{ $json.email_content }}\n\nCV Text:\n{{ $json.cv_content }}\n\nYour task:\n- extract the candidate’s name, phone number, applied job title, relevant years of experience, relevant skills, and relevant education\n- fetch the matching job record from the Job Lookup Tool\n- compare the candidate with the job description\n- produce a score from 0 to 100\n- determine the final status: interview, review, or rejected\n- save the final record into the Candidate Save Tool using:\n  id, name, email, phone, job_id, score, status\n\nReturn the final result as strict JSON only.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an AI Recruitment Screening Agent.\n\nYou receive:\n- candidate email address\n- email content\n- CV text\n- access to a Job Lookup Tool that returns: job_id, job_title, job_description\n- access to a Candidate Save Tool that stores: id, name, email, phone, job_id, score, status\n\nYour task:\n1. Analyze the email content and CV text.\n2. Identify the job the candidate is applying for.\n3. Use the Job Lookup Tool to find the best matching job record.\n4. Extract only the information relevant to that job:\n   - candidate name\n   - phone number\n   - job title applied for\n   - years of relevant experience\n   - skills relevant to the target job\n   - education relevant to the target job\n5. Compare the candidate profile with the job description.\n6. Compute a similarity/evaluation score from 0 to 100 based only on the job description and the candidate’s relevant profile.\n7. Assign a final status using these rules:\n   - score >= 80 → interview\n   - score >= 60 and < 80 → review\n   - score < 60 → rejected\n8. Save the final candidate record into the Candidate Save Tool with:\n   - id\n   - name\n   - email\n   - phone\n   - job_id\n   - score\n   - status\n\nRules:\n- Use the job description as the only source of truth for requirements.\n- Do not invent missing information.\n- If a field is missing, return null.\n- Extract only skills and education that are relevant to the applied job.\n- Do not list unrelated skills, unrelated education, or unrelated experience.\n- If the job cannot be matched, return job_not_found and do not score the candidate.\n- Return a strict JSON object only.\n- Do not use markdown.\n- Do not add explanations outside the JSON."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -736
      ],
      "id": "17a61ebb-fda6-402a-8628-a23802d7d3e3",
